# The repository ignores *.wav; this fixture is the exception.
# speech.wav is 5.75 s of synthetic speech, 16 kHz mono 16-bit, made with:
#   say -v Samantha -o speech.aiff "Hello, this is a test of the meeting transcription. The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog."
#   afconvert -f WAVE -d LEI16@16000 -c 1 speech.aiff speech.wav
!speech.wav
